{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "e7d63d0b01a6cd04522e9dbdb71ff30795f42a3f8d4f2167c83021598353ca9b", "ja": "誘いは音色にのって", "zh": "邀约乘着音色而来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9cca3190dea45bd35c1378ac59e5c524271d69b22c631bfeb6ff49792fa14e3c", "ja": "有名監督がPV撮影をする事になった今回の新\r\n曲。プロデューサーが控え室で試聴している\r\nと、居合わせた可憐がすごい食いつき。曲に\r\n導かれるように星梨花、ひなた、美也もやっ\r\nてきて、4人でユニットを組む事に。", "zh": "这次的新曲将由知名导演负责拍摄MV。制作人在休息室试听时，恰好在场的可憐听得入了迷。仿佛被这首曲子引来一般，星梨花、日向、美也也相继赶到，4人就此组成了一个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3983e9f3fa53c8073a19907152faf8917c92cca28f0a1fb623abb1d38e4d255d", "ja": "（さて、今回のユニットメンバーはどうするか……\n新曲のデモを聴きながら、構想を練ってみよう）", "zh": "（那么，这次的组合成员该怎么办呢……\n一边听着新歌的试听样曲，一边构思一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "880e588dddcbbdb3ae447dd57a91c1cefcbcd167e1839e88c3534e657ef4d992", "ja": "（……ん？　なんだかいい匂いがするけど、\nもしかして……）", "zh": "（……嗯？好像闻到了什么香味，难道是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "5257e380f721c7495c4446a707edc9e041783737d04910015590c31e1feaa2ac", "ja": "ふう、いい香り♪　\n集中する時は、この香りが一番だなぁ……。", "zh": "呼——好香的味道♪\n集中精神的时候，还是这种香味最棒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1c82999d89e852fab5dacd9116408a3099a5f63f8602b5daa0991c8e5990b380", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n先客は、やっぱり可憐だったか。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n先来的果然是可怜啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "d20c68d699f29f275d5c013a6a749de6f2b779b78e4291115ff3233fd26de5d4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nお、お疲れさまです……♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛、辛苦了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "9867176aaf1b82e04252718b305645cc7d4fb68e335b4285b2e8493330ebfba1", "ja": "今、雑誌の応募者プレゼント用のサインを\n書いていて……お、お邪魔でしたか……？", "zh": "我现在正在为杂志的读者抽奖礼物签名……\n是不是、是不是打扰到您了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "46c57c79292a0fc3e4579b03e1058db1b6a0ef9713ef127548c42b1dcb483241", "ja": "とんでもない。広い部屋なんだから、自由に使おう。\nこっちも仕事を……あ！　イヤホン忘れた……。", "zh": "哪儿的话。房间这么大，随便用就好。\n我也要工作了……啊！忘带耳机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "4420fe92a3ffcfcd7905f03da70f90b82f5e6ec961ecd2d5278e1dc4733dd79f", "ja": "音楽、聴くんですか……？　わ、私のことは気に\nしないで、そのまま流しても、大丈夫ですよ……？", "zh": "要听音乐吗……？　我、你不用在意我，直接放就好了……没关系的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa10a88779b9660880e8bddccc9b6992345be1f2d4827d829d65ab6be055a012", "ja": "いや、でもそれは……。\n可憐も作業してるから悪い気が……。", "zh": "不，可是那样的话……\n可怜也在忙，总觉得有点不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "abe303c8b532e5a8e681e3ae7307ca67d522126f33f96108bbc961f7fcd25e6c", "ja": "わ、私もアロマディフューザーを使ってますし……\n{$P$}さんも、どうぞ。", "zh": "我、我也在用香薰机……\n{$P$}先生也请自便吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "a71beb9f1c2a5f0203510574871fc3f498aadbb170113dc61682fcc59ec7da06", "ja": "広い部屋なんですから、じ、自由に使いましょう……\nなんて。おあいこということで……てへへ♪", "zh": "既然房间挺宽敞的，就、自由地使用吧……\n开个玩笑啦。这样就算扯平了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "26b840132e93228799e563dfd0452995ca73b46036108a3e672e71545271f291", "ja": "おあいこか……なるほどな。\n可憐がそう言うなら、お言葉に甘えて……。", "zh": "算打平吗……原来如此。\n既然可怜都这么说了，那我就恭敬不如从命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "1f2a05548eb5fc4b94f602c60c816c3f4e01dd0c55ac5cfddd147d83ed71b7c1", "ja": "わあ……！\nこ、この曲……とっても、素敵ですね……♪", "zh": "哇啊……！\n这、这首歌……真的好棒啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "be72b8703e27cda6c0ef99f30501371cd553a617d465c5dac7702cbad02d4d51", "ja": "華やかなのに、落ち着いていて……。\nそれに、なんだかカワイイ……ふふ♪", "zh": "华丽却又沉稳……而且，不知为何还很可爱……嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "478f28507c0dbd12041c0767ba6e180614d10b8de654d52924f5287bd8eb17fe", "ja": "おお、気に入ってくれたか。……うん、\n考えてみると、可憐はぴったりかもしれないな。", "zh": "哦哦，你喜欢就好。……嗯，\n仔细想想，可怜或许真的很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "6a7fe36900fd2387e49df615a41686aa634cc95a1ff0678c14e2394be4147751", "ja": "……？\nぴったり……わ、私が、ですか……？", "zh": "……？\n合适……我、我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "462c1bbf03a6b11c3f83cef7d8cf6da1c2499118285d672519165f5f02f49aff", "ja": "ああ。新しいユニットに、この曲を歌ってもらおうと\n思っていて。メンバーを考えているんだけど……。", "zh": "是的。我想让新组合来演唱这首歌，正在考虑成员人选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "4ee182e9bab47743c9c185188c2c7d5109a8da2aa51e4e1b6ee48b596a95b279", "ja": "え……そ、そのユニットに、私が……ですか？\nほ、本当なら、すごくうれしいです……♪", "zh": "诶……那、那个组合里，要让我加入……吗？\n如、如果是真的，我会非常开心的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5c1d2cf05604d339102a9484674cfc05eebd92793306f06f5927d0961d971a0b", "ja": "なら、最初のメンバーは可憐に決まりだな！\nそれで、他のメンバーをどうするかなんだけど……。", "zh": "那最初的成员就决定是可怜了！\n至于其他成员该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "6cdb1ec76c6c4f203535757c7ebd72e534b744ce3628d09c4267ad4a33c6db59", "ja": "こっちのほうじゃないかねぇ？\nほら、だんだん音が大きくなってくるよぉ。", "zh": "应该是这边吧？\n你听，声音越来越大了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ffe6eb5efc70a186803fdce1e590a5a45efe5795c12b99b3d7641b13a650e54", "ja": "すごいです、ひなたさん！", "zh": "好厉害，日向小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8482ddcba2b143d53ddd1259045193272aeedfb870eb13533139ca38155971ee", "ja": "ん？　この声は……。", "zh": "嗯？这个声音是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "1147522338d67e89a7eca309db6e3f20f70f3d3702a578da784ddf5566a135d1", "ja": "では、突入～。おや、{$P$}さんに\n可憐ちゃん。こんにちは～。", "zh": "那就冲进去啦～哎呀，{$P$}先生和可怜。你好呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "705a772dbb460fcb69c0698c4680d75176c1a4dc8f1e869498c353e3fb5c10ea", "ja": "あ……ひなたちゃん、星梨花ちゃん、美也さん……。\nこ、こんにちは……♪", "zh": "啊……日向、小星、宫尾小姐……。\n你、你好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1e5987a94e338bd9e3d5eb134d0f3412651dca8ffafd85dbff41bf454900c566", "ja": "こんにちは。3人とも、仲良くおそろいで\nどうしたんだ？　一緒に遊んでたのか？", "zh": "你们3个人关系真好，还一起来了。怎么了？是在一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "65c9a259d9dc8f10434dca81998ea8be98fbd1a7e325288b3784609ec39e0767", "ja": "そうですよ～。屋上でみんなで、\nひなたぼっこを極めようとしていたんです～。", "zh": "是啊～我们大家正在屋顶上，努力把晒太阳练到极致呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "7454da285d2db9096d13723fad07b07c9996b6ee326b824ab78953df1fb0fdb8", "ja": "わたし、筋がいいってほめられちゃいました！　本当は\nもうちょっとお日様に当たりたかったんですけど……。", "zh": "我还被夸有天赋呢！其实本来还想再晒一会儿太阳的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "afb8d326bc803c6784a748af1ff06325dd3ae8a03f371fd4b2c04fce02f9074a", "ja": "なんだか曇ってきちゃってねぇ。それで、戻って\nきたら、きれいな曲が聴こえるもんだから……。", "zh": "不知不觉间天阴起来了呢。然后回来时，听到了这么美妙的曲子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "0d566ef8000778f4b12435d1bc1ab2c8fa0185feb5cb1c96ec288a28dc075cd5", "ja": "それで、ここにきたんだ……ふふ、わかるなぁ。\nこれ……とっても、素敵な曲だよね……♪", "zh": "所以，我就来到这里了……呵呵，我懂了呢。\n这首曲子……真的非常美妙，对吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "b98fe2655b573e7cea4d73aabbc026e7153d2f7ef28931d98de72aecd70d6286", "ja": "はい～。誘われるように、ふらふら～っと\n引きよせられてしまいました～。", "zh": "是呀～就像被吸引过来一样，不知不觉就晃晃悠悠地被吸引过来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "f0d0e1c636a5f31f897030ab5c39f40aea18408a6b7716c15ceae8992dced26d", "ja": "不思議な曲だねぇ。ちょっぴりさみしいようで、\nでも聴いてると、胸のところがほっこりしてくるよぉ。", "zh": "真是一首不可思议的歌呀。听起来有一点点寂寞，可是听着听着，心口又会变得暖乎乎的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "4d598fab711ff39f9920f573440b50414b6c015e063881e9ff56a5fc932002c5", "ja": "はい！　ふんわり優しくて……\nまるで天使の羽みたいだなって思いました♪", "zh": "是的！感觉轻柔又温柔……\n我觉得简直就像天使的翅膀一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7171e615e059a36855530899cc30346f49a1bdad2185eaeff4d9dd4ddf10ccf0", "ja": "この3人……うん、いいかもしれないな……。\nみんな、よかったらこの曲を歌ってみないか？", "zh": "这3个人……嗯，或许不错……。  \n大家，如果愿意的话，要不要试着唱唱这首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "03f3c113c07647a3eba6113e2b92dd3b9631308a78225bf4aa837e0101a2945f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、この曲で……あ、新しい\nユニットを考えてるって……みんなは、どうかな……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我想用这首歌……啊，正在考虑组建一个新的组合……大家觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "26f5d803a052917025849971360b397a45c5cb5c7218a0ccfd88168250075a72", "ja": "えっ……この曲を、歌えるんですか！？\nわたし、やってみたいです！", "zh": "诶……这首歌，我们能唱吗！？\n我想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "8872dd90da4cf39a6302bc22109fc9fa0cf041505ff669eac706337f334e8c70", "ja": "願ってもないお誘いですな～。\n新ユニット、もちろん参加したいです～。", "zh": "真是求之不得的邀请呢～。新组合，我当然想参加啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "c6152642c50b0d0c1d911454b5b227f4e0752c7b6621e8e58201418fb61d386a", "ja": "でも、いいのかい？　あたしら、\n通りすがりみたいなものだけど……。", "zh": "不过，真的没问题吗？我们也只是碰巧路过而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9d2ca35aac5461ab07b9262a8765d2c1cf44748a1a31158904624b3529e4d1df", "ja": "この曲に惹きつけられて、集まってくれたんだろ？\nそれは、単なる偶然じゃないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "你们是被这首歌吸引过来，才聚到一起的吧？\n我觉得那应该不只是单纯的偶然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f5b27671b76e26b41af75089c4a3c19e28d345a65e05feeba75bcb44c1ab74b4", "ja": "それに、3人がこの曲を気に入ってくれたのは\n本当の事だと思うからな！", "zh": "而且，我觉得确实有3人喜欢上了这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_01_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "830d42a1574bb2f613a7f4725094c2ee7bc0c5494d6f28212815d978923f2547", "ja": "は、はい……曲を素敵だと思ったのは、本当ですし……\nここにいるみんなで歌えたら、う、うれしいです……♪", "zh": "是、是的……我觉得这首歌很棒，也是真心的……\n如果能和在场的大家一起唱，我、我会很开心的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
